Data sources
------------

The pipeline collects from external public APIs (Copernicus CAMS, NOAA
GEFS/GFS, EEA, NASA FIRMS, Open-Meteo, AirKorea, OpenAQ, Sensor.Community,
etc.). Their licenses and attribution requirements
apply to the collected data in the published dataset
(huggingface.co/datasets/Robeedau/airlens-live) — they do not govern this
codebase. The per-source license, required attribution text and terms links are
listed in DATA_SOURCES.md.
